{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It'sRoachTime! - is a hardcore, third person 3D online pvp fighting arena game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Fight as a mutant cockroach in real time insect simulator, find your way to survive, destroy them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Various themed arenas in the post-Soviet apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Standard weapons are the past, fight with homemade needles, razor blades, paws of birds and insects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* How you decide to defeat your opponents is entirely up to you. Assault from the front and fight all at once or ambush enemies one at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Unique cockroach music and sound effects from the &quot;Henry&quot; band.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Comic Artist's works Sergei Kritzien.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* The apartment is fraught with danger: gas fire, explosions and falls. We add more and more dangerous surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/984790/extras/f5bfb3e1845718a749f853ed201f328c.poster.avif?t=1735066218\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/984790/extras/f5bfb3e1845718a749f853ed201f328c.webm?t=1735066218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/984790/extras/f5bfb3e1845718a749f853ed201f328c.mp4?t=1735066218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"","localized_name":"\u0422\u0430\u0440\u0430\u043a\u0430\u043d \u043a \u0443\u0441\u043f\u0435\u0445\u0443 \u0448\u0451\u043b","name":"\u0422\u0430\u0440\u0430\u043a\u0430\u043d \u043a \u0443\u0441\u043f\u0435\u0445\u0443 \u0448\u0451\u043b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/984790/"}],"total